# Done Criteria

Bug fix:
- reproducible issue
- confirmed fix
- relevant tests pass
- no unrelated behavior change

Feature:
- matches spec
- includes necessary tests
- does not break existing contracts
- add short docs note if behavior changed

Refactor:
- no behavior change
- better structure/readability
- all tests pass
- clear and focused diff

Before merge:
- lint
- build
- unit tests
- integration tests for critical flows
- reviewer or tester signoff

Execution policy:
- pre-defined test suites are safe-by-default and do not require manual approval gates
